<title>POLAND: Poland wheat prices jump, other grains also up.</title>
<headline>Poland wheat prices jump, other grains also up.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Agriculture Ministry said in a statement that wheat prices jumped at last week's grain auctions while barley and rye prices inched up.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM AUCTION PRICES</p>
<p> Product  week to July 14   to July 7     mnth/mnth    yr/yr</p>
<p> Wheat     55.13 zl/q	 52.25 zl/q     5.8 pct   -16.1 pct</p>
<p> Rye	 40.00 zl/q	 39.64 zl/q     0.7 pct    -6.3 pct</p>
<p> Barley    47.70 zl/q	 46.53 zl/q     2.1 pct   -17.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: zl/q = zlotys per quintal.</p>
<p>--Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
